# AJALI! ADMIN — RE-AUDIT (2026-08-20)

**Do not rebuild.** Prefer incremental fixes through the existing service layer.

Re-audited against: `admin-frontend.mdc` acceptance demo, prior backlog (many DONE), and current product direction (map-hero Dashboard + Analytics charts).

---

## Product layout (current)

| Route | Role |
|-------|------|
| `/admin` | **Dashboard** — map hero + Latest reports + Newest users (VERIFIED / IN_PROGRESS reporters). Light; create via **Add report** modal. |
| `/admin/analytics` | **Analytics** — KPI strip (`getDashboardStats`) + Needs attention + charts |
| `/admin/incidents…` | Inbox / detail / edit / review (no dedicated create page) |
| `/admin/map` | Full ops map (shared `IncidentMapMarker`) |
| `/admin/departments` | Department CRUD |
| `/admin/notifications` | Notification center |
| `/admin/audit-log` | Audit trail |

`/admin/incidents/new` redirects to `/admin` — creation is Quick Create only.

---

## A. Still solid

- Urgency ≠ severity; verification records; departments + handoffs; resolve + citizen SMS/email prompt
- Service contracts → `api.ts` (no component-local seed mutation)
- RBAC: all `/admin/*` behind `ProtectedRoute` ADMIN
- Shell: sidebar `md+`, bottom bar mobile, Quick Create (“Add report”), breadcrumbs below navbar (hidden on Dashboard home)
- Shared `IncidentMapMarker` (dashboard + ops map)
- Durable media (`toDurableMediaUrl`); media in quick-create `mediaSlot`
- Inbox list DTO `verificationStatus` (no N+1); server-shaped `IncidentListQuery` (+ `statusIn` for active ops)
- Review: verify/close/start response/resolve/reopen, handoff cancel, urgency/severity update, notes, mini-map
- Detail: verification, handoffs, lat/lng, media, archive
- Edit: discard Dialog + `beforeunload`
- Location search + map pick on forms
- Notifications: mark all / filters / badge event; Audit: reference + filters + mobile cards
- ERD: `docs/erd.dbml`, `docs/ERD.md`

