## Working rules for future agents

1. Inspect existing admin code before adding parallel systems.
2. All mutations go through services → `api.ts`.
3. Status changes stay in moderation/review — not the edit form.
4. Charts belong on **Analytics**; Dashboard stays map-first and low cognitive load.
5. Prefer wiring `getDashboardStats()` over re-aggregating full lists in the UI for KPIs.
6. Keep citizen-facing pages untouched unless a shared component requires it.
7. Incident creation for admins is **Quick Create modal only** — do not reintroduce `/admin/incidents/new` as a full page.

When implementing from this backlog, mark items DONE with a one-line note rather than rewriting the whole file.
